    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέκλον</span></b> , τό,= Lat.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speculum, mirror</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				29.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			= Lat. <i>lapis specularis</i>, i.e. <i>mica</i> or
				<i>talc,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				70
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				150
			</span></i>: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπεκλοποιός</span></b> ,
				ὁ, <i>specularius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
